  "details": "",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient side road (diverticulum) connecting the Via Appia to ancient Bovillae was rediscovered in 2014 construction work in modern Frattocchie. A section of the road was conserved and can be visited beneath the McDonald's restaurant now occupying the site. Other remains of the road have been identified to the west.",
